{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016XEeosRxRqX1tstWFWegBN","type":"tool_result","content":"Here are the exact sentences from the page:\n\n(1) \"But files whose name begins with an underscore (`_`) are assumed to _not_ have a manifest inside. These files are not rendered to Kubernetes object definitions, but are available everywhere within other chart templates for use.\"\n\n(2) \"In fact, when we first created `mychart`, we saw a file called `_helpers.tpl`. That file is the default location for template partials.\"\n\n(3) \"The `define` action allows us to create a named template inside of a template file.\"\n\nNote: The page discusses `template` and `include` separately rather than as a single unified concept. The `include` function section states: \"To work around this case, Helm provides an alternative to `template` that will import the contents of a template into the present pipeline where it can be passed along to other functions in the pipeline.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba092422-5310-41aa-b517-7e6c04f864c8","uuid":"44a8df38-921c-4403-abd5-6d88b839e700","timestamp":"2026-08-31T08:34:29.732Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":97804,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Here are the exact sentences from the page:\n\n(1) \"But files whose name begins with an underscore (`_`) are assumed to _not_ have a manifest inside. These files are not rendered to Kubernetes object definitions, but are available everywhere within other chart templates for use.\"\n\n(2) \"In fact, when we first created `mychart`, we saw a file called `_helpers.tpl`. That file is the default location for template partials.\"\n\n(3) \"The `define` action allows us to create a named template inside of a template file.\"\n\nNote: The page discusses `template` and `include` separately rather than as a single unified concept. The `include` function section states: \"To work around this case, Helm provides an alternative to `template` that will import the contents of a template into the present pipeline where it can be passed along to other functions in the pipeline.\"","durationMs":3672,"url":"https://helm.sh/docs/chart_template_guide/named_templates/"}}
