{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\"\n*   service \"B-Service\"\n\nAfter installation/upgrade of chart A a single Helm release is created/modified. The release will create/update all of the above Kubernetes objects in the following order:\n\n*   A-Namespace\n*   B-Namespace\n*   A-Service"}},"session_id":"ba092422-5310-41aa-b517-7e6c04f864c8","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"c3f63e23-ba17-4042-bdf9-fe01f5b90588"}
{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n*   B-Service\n*   B-ReplicaSet\n*   A-StatefulSet\n\nThis is because when Helm installs/upgrades charts, the Kubernetes objects from the charts and all its dependencies are\n\n*   aggregated into a single set; then\n*   sorted by"}},"session_id":"ba092422-5310-41aa-b517-7e6c04f864c8","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"8554b360-8a25-4e01-8513-3d9108e2889e"}
